_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/02f65f4c/uploads/origins/708cb136-43d2-4667-8b6b-1766f73e2d9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0c21f359a8465fb59bb3fe6d77868a1", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/02f65f4c/uploads/origins/708cb136-43d2-4667-8b6b-1766f73e2d9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=969b2db104a1817cb49d8c1b63a46f1f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "すみません、このキャラクター（サワー）をお願いしたいです。\nかっこいいな描画がとても好きです.内容は宙に浮く六尺褌を着た侍.その他の內容 月天助さんにお任せします！\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nサワー: https://i.imgur.com/dwEpY97.jpg\n\nhttps://imgur.com/dwEpY97", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@gettensuke9/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 58510, "client_id": 1728376, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/43343ed9/uploads/origins/f3cf0f3b-f2e0-466c-94f5-18cdb1eb7029?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cabdbeb7dee38023c4b1e0c1e2accc4d", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/43343ed9/uploads/origins/f3cf0f3b-f2e0-466c-94f5-18cdb1eb7029?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4d955126b9af50288068ca0871503a4c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "いつもイラスト楽しみにしてます！良ければ三世さんと群青君を軽めの落書きでも良いので一枚のキャンバスに収めて複数描いていただけたらなと思います。(書き込み具合やカラーモノクロ構図全てお任せします)よろしくお願いします！", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@gettensuke9/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 58510, "client_id": 1358769, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/18116cc9/uploads/